# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132) accepted (a GM) by level 66 chars of the jobs Qu'Bia Arena serves: PLD (7), DRK (8), BRD (10),
# one char each (main the first). Each trades its job's testimony (64 with its job id) and answers 1: tradedTestimony
# 1, set down at Qu'Bia Arena (-225.146 -24.250 20.057, zone 206); the char zones at the next tick.
# Then each char, in the flow's order, enters its own Maat fight in its own area (1, 2, 3: the fights of one zone
# run side by side): a GM warp by BC_Entrance (the flow parser follows zones by warp), the testimony traded (the 32000
# menu), 32000 updated with option index * 16 + area (registered, entered; the testimony wears), finished; that
# area's Maat "killed" (unkillable: 1 HP; he yields, battlefield:win, at a later onMobFight, so some kills take ticks
# before the 32001 opens; battlefieldWin the fight's id), and the win's 32001 finished: accepted, so a Scroll of
# Instant Warp, Prog = the job id, the job's maatsCap bit (1 << (job - 1): a fresh char's maatsCap is 0), Maat Masher.
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrade RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/64 QubiaArena/BC_Entrance/onTrade QubiaArena/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=PLD lvl=66
char drk zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=DRK lvl=66
char brd zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=BRD lvl=66
levelcap 70
quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
item PaladinsTestimony
drk: levelcap 70
drk: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
drk: item DarkKnightsTestimony
brd: levelcap 70
brd: quest Jeuno.ShatteringStars accepted
brd: item BardsTestimony
login
trade Maat PaladinsTestimony x1         # PLD's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (7)
finish option=1                         # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Qu'Bia Arena
tick 400
login                                   # in Qu'Bia Arena
drk: login
drk: trade Maat DarkKnightsTestimony x1 # DRK's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (8)
drk: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Qu'Bia Arena
tick 400
drk: login                              # in Qu'Bia Arena
brd: login
brd: trade Maat BardsTestimony x1       # BRD's testimony, Prog 0: 64 (10)
brd: finish option=1                    # tradedTestimony 1; set down at Qu'Bia Arena
tick 400
brd: login                              # in Qu'Bia Arena
warp -212.2,-24.6,20.1 QubiaArena       # by BC_Entrance
trade BC_Entrance PaladinsTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
update 32000 option=81                  # Shattering Stars (PLD), index 5, area 1: registered, entered
finish                                  # in the arena
kill MAAT                               # Maat (PLD) of area 1: 1 HP (unkillable), won once he yields, battlefieldWin 517
tick 1000                               # Maat is unkillable: he yields (battlefield:win) in a later onMobFight; 32001 opens on the last tick
tick 1000
tick 1000
finish                                  # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 7, maatsCap 64, Maat Masher
drk: warp -212.2,-24.6,20.1 QubiaArena  # by BC_Entrance
drk: trade BC_Entrance DarkKnightsTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
drk: update 32000 option=98             # Shattering Stars (DRK), index 6, area 2: registered, entered
drk: finish                             # in the arena
drk: kill MAAT+4                        # Maat (DRK) of area 2: won, battlefieldWin 518, 32001 opens
drk: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 8, maatsCap 128, Maat Masher
brd: warp -212.2,-24.6,20.1 QubiaArena  # by BC_Entrance
brd: trade BC_Entrance BardsTestimony x1  # tradedTestimony 1: the 32000 menu
brd: update 32000 option=115            # Shattering Stars (BRD), index 7, area 3: registered, entered
brd: finish                             # in the arena
brd: kill MAAT+8                        # Maat (BRD) of area 3: 1 HP (unkillable), won once he yields, battlefieldWin 519
tick 1000                               # Maat is unkillable: he yields (battlefield:win) in a later onMobFight; 32001 opens on the last tick
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
tick 1000
brd: finish                             # 32001, accepted: the scroll, Prog 10, maatsCap 512, Maat Masher
